Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 13:54:18 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1051/1198] Post: Run the chain

1054 (Viktor): one row above Post's steps runs them in order on Forge, each
on the file the one before made: Debuzz (for every YuE2 take; off for an
imported track) -> Upscale (optional, subtle/normal/high) -> Remaster (always,
with the settings of the Remaster step: 432 Hz, LUFS, preset), then the
checks on the final file: Artifacts, Spectrum; the lyrics heard on the take;
stems. The page starts it and watches it step by step; closing the page stops
nothing; a failed step says so and what was made before it stays.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
